---
import CustomNav from '../components/Navigation.jsx'
import CustomFooter from '../components/Footer.jsx'
import ProjectNav from '../components/ProjectNav.jsx'
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
        <title>Logo Work | Kassidy Lewis | Graphic Designer</title>
        <link href="/src/styles/global.css" rel="stylesheet">
        <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/portfolio/favicon.svg">
    </head>
    <body id="top" class="font-body text-sm md:text-base">
        <header>
            <nav class="p-6 bg-black" aria-labelledby="site-navigation">
                <CustomNav />
            </nav>
        </header>
        <main>
            <section class="pt-6 md:pt-12 pb-12 px-6 md:px-24 xl:px-64">
                <a href="/portfolio/projects.html" class="font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-angles-left mr-1 text-xs"></i>Back to Projects
                </a>
                <h1 class="pt-4 font-display text-6xl xl:text-8xl">Logo Work</h1>
                <div class="pt-2 grid grid-cols-[2fr_1fr_2fr] gap-4">
                    <img 
                        src="/src/images/design/alesco_overview.png" 
                        alt="Four logo designs for Alesco Design Solutions shown side-by-side" 
                        class="col-span-3 w-full h-full object-cover"
                    >
                    <img 
                        src="/src/images/design/alesco_sticker.png" 
                        alt="Sticker sheet featuring several green logo stickers" 
                        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                    >
                    <img 
                        src="/src/images/design/alesco_final.png" 
                        alt="The rectangular logo for Alesco Design Solutions shown on a pale green background" 
                        class="col-span-2 w-full h-full object-cover"
                    >
                    <img 
                        src="/src/images/design/alesco_website.png" 
                        alt="Screenshot of the home page of alescods.com" 
                        class="col-span-3 lg:col-span-2 w-full h-full object-cover"
                    >
                    <div id="the-objective" class="col-span-3 lg:col-span-1 pt-6 flex">
                        <div class="self-center w-full">
                            <div class="flex justify-between">
                                <h2 class="font-display text-4xl">The Objective</h2>
                                <div class="flex mt-1 gap-2">
                                    <img
                                        src="/src/images/svg/icon-illustrator.svg"
                                        alt="Logo of Adobe Illustrator"
                                        class="h-7"
                                    >
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <p class="pt-4 lg:pb-4">Creating and presenting a series of potential logo designs for two small businesses.</p>
                            <div class="hidden lg:block -ml-36 h-15 bg-teal mix-blend-exclusion">
                                &nbsp;
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <nav class="md:my-12 p-6 md:px-24 lg:px-64 xl:px-96 text-center bg-black text-white" aria-labelledby="page-navigation">
                <em>Jump to:</em>
                <ul class="pt-2 flex justify-center divide-x-3 divide-grey font-semibold transition-all">
                    <li>
                        <a href="#the-objective" class="pr-4 font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">
                            Objective
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a href="#the-method" class="px-4 font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">
                            Method
                        </a>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a href="#the-lesson" class="pl-4 font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">
                            Lesson
                        </a>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
            <div class="px-6 md:px-24 lg:px-64 xl:px-96">
                <section id="the-method" class="py-12 border-b-3 border-grey/25">
                    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl">The Method</h2>
                    <p class="py-4">In addition to illustration commissions, I have been contracted for logo work several times. Displayed on this page is the branding of <a href="https://alescods.com/" class="font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">Alesco Design Solutions</a>, a landscaping firm based in Phoenix, Arizona, and of <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/timthesingingcarpenter/" class="font-semibold hover:text-teal hover:underline decoration-2 underline-offset-3 transition-all duration-300">Tim the Singing Carpenter</a>, a New York City-based theatrical contractor.
                    <p>In the case of Alesco, specialties of the firm include environmental planning, placemaking, aesthetics, and sustainability. It also prides itself in its local Arizona presence. With this in mind, I set out to craft the logo that would best represent their values.</p>
                    <div class="py-6 text-center">
                        <img 
                            src="/src/images/design/alesco_wip.png" 
                            alt="Green text logo shown in various font styles and pairings" 
                            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
                        >
                        <p class="pt-2 text-grey">Various Alesco typeface variants that were presented during development. Lusitana wins out in the end.</p>
                    </div>
                    <p>It is pertinent to establish <i>where</i> a logo will appear, as well. Alesco's logo(s) were planned for use in signage, printed documents, sticker sheets, and on a website, indicating that the logos should be exported in PNG and SVG format to accommodate these mediums. The main logo takes on a rectangular shape, but several variants of the final design also appear on a 4 x 6 inch sticker sheet.</p>
                </section>
                <section id="the-lesson" class="py-12 border-b-3 border-grey/25">
                    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl">The Lesson</h2>
                    <p class="pt-4">The branding project of Alesco is one of the first design ventures I have ever completed in a professional setting. I'm accustomed to contacting clients via social media and email, but this project allowed me to meet with a client face-to-face and develop a personal understanding of their needs. It was an excellent real-world experience.</p>
                </section>
                <nav class="py-12" aria-labelledby="project-navigation">
                    <ProjectNav
                        src_left="/src/images/design/mockup_desktop.png"
                        alt_left="Webpage mockup shown on two desktop monitors"
                        link_left="/portfolio/page-mockup.html"
                        name_left="Page Mockup"
                        src_right="/src/images/design/socmed_comms.png"
                        alt_right="Two social media graphics titled: Commission Prices"
                        link_right="/portfolio/social-media-graphics.html"
                        name_right="Social Media Graphics"
                    />
                </nav>
            </div>
        </main>
        <footer class="py-12 px-6 md:px-24 lg:px-64 xl:px-96 text-white bg-black">
            <CustomFooter />
        </footer>
        <!-- Scripts -->
        <script src="https://kit.fontawesome.com/f3040639fe.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
        <noscript>Your browser does not support JavaScript!</noscript>
    </body>
</html>